    threads as a searchable public knowledge base under a subdomain (e.g. <code>example.dejavue.app</code>) or a
    custom domain, with optional AI features (drafted answers, summaries, topic clustering, auto-FAQ, semantic
    search, MCP access).
  </p>
  <p>
